    "value": "Complete original52-cost comparison on both entire actual saturated J faces. All32 previous287 scalar observations remain; only the complete H4 source bound is strengthened by288. Its same-source375 event refines all eight original marked states and their complements while preserving every264 row, independent original labels, common late parameter and every exponent/cofactor tail. The complete2/4/6/7/8 prefix ledger and all residual375 leaves cover every3.125 billion containing choice. All59 whole-positive-integer envelopes and59 fresh finite moment witnesses are checked against all32 updated constraints. Exact mass3/20, all52 positive cost weights, signed mass, outside square, all four AP11 blocks, the updated AP13 survival deduction and the complete count tail are recomputed. The lower witnesses delimit only this independent scalar-moment method and need not be actual sources or mutually compatible. No actual attainment, off-face/global join, unrestricted Erdos7 result or Lean verification is asserted."
